// Tags: attack.execution, attack.persistence, attack.initial-access, attack.privilege-escalation, attack.stealth, attack.t1059.009, attack.t1078.004
// Description: Detects S3 Browser utility performing reconnaissance looking for existing IAM Users without a LoginProfile defined then (when found) creating a LoginProfile.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(eventSource EQ "iam.amazonaws.com" AND (eventName EQ "GetLoginProfile" OR eventName EQ "CreateLoginProfile") AND userAgent CONTAINS "S3 Browser")
